 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've got a discharge and it's really itchy down there. I've had it for about a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for telling me. Can you describe the discharge?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's thick and white, a bit like cottage cheese. No smell."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the itching, is it inside or outside?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Outside mostly, and it burns when I pass urine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain during sex, or bleeding between periods?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit sore during sex, but no bleeding."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had anything like this before?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A couple of times, years ago. It cleared up with a cream."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The contraceptive pill, and I took antibiotics last month for a chest infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which antibiotic was that, and for how long?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amoxicillin, 500 mg, three times a day, for five days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, that's helpful, because antibiotics can bring on thrush. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I don't have any allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you pregnant, or could you be?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I had my period two weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you use any soaps, bubble baths, or douches?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sometimes a scented body wash. Nothing inside."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With your permission, I'd like to do a quick examination and a swab. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's redness and some white curd-like discharge on the vulva, and no sores."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it thrush? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It looks very much like thrush, a yeast infection. The swab will confirm it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will you give me something for it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, I'll prescribe fluconazole, 150 mg, a single capsule, and clotrimazole cream for the itching."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it safe with my pill? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, there's no problem with the contraceptive pill. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And should I avoid anything? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid scented soaps and tight synthetic underwear for now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it hasn't cleared up in a week, come back and we'll look again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
